  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Moldova Reforming Courts IDF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The grant&apos;s development objective is to enhance court performance with a special focus on the commercial jurisdiction. The objective will be achieved through improved court organization, more strategic and results-focused management; and more streamlined commercial decision-making procedures. Better performing courts will have a positive influence on the business environment and investment climate in Moldova. If the grant is successful it is likely to improve governance and reduce corruption.  The proposed grant has three components: (i) Improving Court Organization; (ii) Strengthening Court Management; and (iii) Streamlining Commercial Court Procedures. TF056346 To enhance the judiciary&apos;s court performance with a special focus on the commercial jurisdictions thorugh improved court organizationm more strategic and results focused management and more streamlined commercial decision making procedures.</narrative>
  </description>
